<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>ECE-KDE on benchmark datasets and models with different calibration methods. Calibration methods VS and HB are not monotonic and suffer from changes in accuracy and prediction rankings. The reported numbers are averaged over 10 runs and are in the scale of <math id="S5.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{-2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
